{"id":"64f7e7a351b06efd","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/782_Priest_悖论逻辑_LP.md","title":"782 Priest 悖论逻辑 LP","display":"782_Priest_悖论逻辑_LP","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"782-Priest-悖论逻辑-LP\">782 Priest 悖论逻辑 LP</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B\">\\(p,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>自由变元函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(B),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(B),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{LP}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{LP}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\}\\)</span>，并定义替换扩张算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{LP}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{LP}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{LP}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{LP}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{LP}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{LP}(\\sigma)\\)</span> 为唯一满足下列递归子句的映射：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子；相应函数与关系的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{LP}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,LP}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{LP}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,LP}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{LP}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,LP}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{LP}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,LP}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-LP-三值矩阵\">4. LP 三值矩阵</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{LP}=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf t\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathbf f&lt;\\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf V_{LP}=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf t\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathbf f&lt;\\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>指定值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf D_{LP}=\\{\\mathbf b,\\mathbf t\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf D_{LP}=\\{\\mathbf b,\\mathbf t\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义运算的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{LP}:\\mathsf V_{LP}\\to\\mathsf V_{LP},\n\\qquad\n\\wedge_{LP},\\vee_{LP}:\\mathsf V_{LP}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{LP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{LP}:\\mathsf V_{LP}\\to\\mathsf V_{LP},\n\\qquad\n\\wedge_{LP},\\vee_{LP}:\\mathsf V_{LP}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{LP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐点定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{LP}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\qquad\n\\neg_{LP}\\mathbf b=\\mathbf b,\\qquad\n\\neg_{LP}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf f,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{LP}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\qquad\n\\neg_{LP}\\mathbf b=\\mathbf b,\\qquad\n\\neg_{LP}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf f,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge_{LP}b=\\min_{\\mathbf f&lt;\\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf t}(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\vee_{LP}b=\\max_{\\mathbf f&lt;\\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf t}(a,b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge_{LP}b=\\min_{\\mathbf f&lt;\\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf t}(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\vee_{LP}b=\\max_{\\mathbf f&lt;\\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf t}(a,b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书\">5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{LP}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf V_{LP}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{LP}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf V_{LP}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{LP}\">\\(v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{LP}\\)</span> 的扩张具有类型</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf V_{LP},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf V_{LP},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{LP}\\overline v(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{LP}\\overline v(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{LP}\\overline v(B),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{LP}\\overline v(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{LP}\\overline v(B),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{LP}\\overline v(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反例证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{LP}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{LP}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{LP}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{LP})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{LP}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{LP}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{LP})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{LP}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-语义后承\">6. 语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{LP}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{LP}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{LP}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{LP}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{LP}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{LP}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{LP}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{LP}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubRule}_{LP}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{LP}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除\">7. 语义证书与证明对象排除</h1>\n<p>语义证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{LP}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{LP}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\)</span>，定义可核验证书对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{LP}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{LP}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{LP}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{LP}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{LP}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{LP}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{LP}\">\\(\\mathsf{Valid}_{LP}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{LP}\">\\(\\Vdash_{LP}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{LP}\">\\(\\mathsf{SemCert}_{LP}\\)</span> 均由本文件的真值集合、指定值集合、赋值扩张和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP}\\)</span> 定义；不引用外部代数类、公式类或命名基逻辑。</p>\n<p>形式证明规则关系的类型及取值声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{LP}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{LP}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{LP}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{LP}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目是 LP 三值矩阵语义后承系统；因此不定义非空 Hilbert 公理集合、证明序列或由规则生成的可证关系。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个语义形式系统\">8. 整个语义形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{LP}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP},\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP},\\operatorname{BV}_{LP},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{LP},\\operatorname{Ext}_{LP},\\equiv_{\\alpha,LP},\n\\mathsf V_{LP},\\mathsf D_{LP},\n\\neg_{LP},\\wedge_{LP},\\vee_{LP},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{LP},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{LP},\n\\Vdash_{LP},\\mathsf{Valid}_{LP},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{LP},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{LP}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{LP}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP},\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP},\\operatorname{BV}_{LP},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{LP},\\operatorname{Ext}_{LP},\\equiv_{\\alpha,LP},\n\\mathsf V_{LP},\\mathsf D_{LP},\n\\neg_{LP},\\wedge_{LP},\\vee_{LP},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{LP},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{LP},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{LP},\n\\Vdash_{LP},\\mathsf{Valid}_{LP},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{LP},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{LP}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异是指定值集合同时包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\">\\(\\mathbf b\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf t\\)</span>；该条目只定义语义后承、反例证书和代换保持关系，不含爆炸规则或 Hilbert 证明系统。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"782-Priest-悖论逻辑-LP","text":"782 Priest 悖论逻辑 LP","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-LP-三值矩阵","text":"4. LP 三值矩阵","level":1},{"id":"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书","text":"5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书","level":1},{"id":"6.-语义后承","text":"6. 语义后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除","text":"7. 语义证书与证明对象排除","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个语义形式系统","text":"8. 整个语义形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}.","display":true},{"tex":"p,\\neg A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(B),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Subst}_{LP}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{LP}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}_{LP}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{LP}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{LP}}.","display":true},{"tex"